class: positive
summary: D127 makes a whole array element at a known position a value and a place, in module and local storage and in a struct's array field, including as a call destination and a call argument
constructs: 0520, 0540, 0670, 0700, 0710, 0750, 1810
program: program.ldn
targets: linux-x86-64, macos-arm64
